# NexArtWO Rules

Follow `AGENTS.md`. Read its five core context files at a new task/context reset, then load only the task-specific row.

Re-read context after scope, branch, or phase changes and before protected work. Never use `Otros/` as current authority. Keep changes small and do not touch protected areas unless the active task and exact owner gate allow them.
